  <h2>3. Role Deep-Dives: What Each Role Does on Which Page</h2>

  <h3>1. Administrator (Bima Ary &bull; <code>admin@gmail.com</code>)</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Screen / Page</th>
