    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Dashboard</strong></td>
        <td><code>#/dashboard</code></td>
        <td>KPI metrics (Shipments, Deliveries, Utilization, OTD%), warehouse capacity progress bars, and the 500-Carrier Real-World Live Telemetry Map.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>User & Access</strong></td>
        <td><code>#/users</code></td>
        <td>User management: create users, assign role access levels, deactivate accounts, and monitor user logins.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Carrier Management</strong></td>
        <td><code>#/carriers</code></td>
        <td>Carrier directory, fleet capacity tracking, on-time delivery scorecards, safety ratings, and insurance compliance.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Resource Overview</strong></td>
        <td><code>#/resources</code></td>
        <td>Fleet equipment register (Trucks, Reefers, Air Charters, Vessels), assigned drivers, and live speed telemetry.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Analytics & Reports</strong></td>
        <td><code>#/analytics</code></td>
        <td>Operational intelligence: route deviation frequencies, resolution time distributions, and carrier compliance metrics.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Exception History</strong></td>
        <td><code>#/exceptions</code></td>
        <td>Audit trail of closed deviations, resolution methods (Detour, Swap, Expedite), and root-cause taxonomy.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>SLA & Rules</strong></td>
        <td><code>#/sla_rules</code></td>
        <td>Configure SLA resolution deadlines, breach countdown rules, grace periods, penalty schedules, and automated resolution rules.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Notification Templates</strong></td>
        <td><code>#/notifications_config</code></td>
        <td>Manage multi-channel alert templates (In-App, SMS, Email) with dynamic variable interpolation.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>AI & Approvals</strong></td>
        <td><code>#/ai_config</code></td>
        <td>Configure predictive intelligence model architecture, prediction horizons, and mandatory human review gates.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Audit Log</strong></td>
        <td><code>#/audit</code></td>
        <td>Immutable security audit trail recording user logins, password changes, data updates, and rule modifications.</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

